<item>
            <title>[LU-20719] lnetctl subcommand usage strings are stale</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20719</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Several lnetctl command usage strings in cmd_list[] were stale&lt;br/&gt;
and did not match the actual supported subcommands. A PR with the modifications below will follow this LU.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Removed &quot;help&quot; from route, net, routing, stats, global, udsp,&lt;br/&gt;
and fault usage strings, since &quot;help&quot; is not a subcommand&lt;br/&gt;
handled by these jt_* functions and was misleading users.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Added &quot;reset&quot; to the stats usage string, since jt_stats&lt;br/&gt;
supports it but it was missing from the usage text.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Added &quot;show&quot; to the udsp usage string, since jt_udsp supports&lt;br/&gt;
it but it was missing from the usage text.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
